# ── LLM Provider (Choose ANY ONE of the following free or paid LLM providers) ──

# Option A: Groq API (RECOMMENDED - 100% FREE, ultra-fast Llama 3.3 70B, NO credit card needed)
# Sign up at: https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...

# Option B: Google Gemini API (100% FREE, Gemini 2.0 Flash, NO credit card needed)
# Sign up at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# GEMINI_API_KEY=AIza...

# Option C: OpenAI API
# Sign up at: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-...

# Option D: Anthropic Claude API
# Sign up at: https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-api03-...


# ── Search API (Provide ONE or MULTIPLE keys for Multi-Engine Hybrid Search) ──
# If multiple keys are provided (e.g. Tavily + Serper), the pipeline queries ALL active
# search engines concurrently, merging and deduplicating results for maximum accuracy!

# Option A: Tavily Search API (RECOMMENDED - 1,000 free searches/month, NO credit card needed)
# Sign up at: https://app.tavily.com/
TAVILY_API_KEY=tvly-...

# Option B: Serper Google Search API (2,500 free searches, NO credit card needed)
# Sign up at: https://serper.dev/
SERPER_API_KEY=...

# Option C: Brave Search API
# Sign up at: https://api.search.brave.com/
# BRAVE_API_KEY=BSA...


# ── Optional Model Settings ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional model override
# For Groq: llama-3.3-70b-versatile, llama3-8b-8192
# For Gemini: gemini-2.0-flash, gemini-1.5-flash
# For Anthropic: claude-sonnet-4-5
# OUTREACH_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
